:: RobinTemple Prayer Event
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<robin-temple-work-check>>
<<if !_robinWork or $RobinTemple.prayer_event_day isnot Time.days or $RobinTemple.prayer_event_resolved>>
  <<lanSwitch 'There is no unfinished encounter here today.' '今天这里已经没有尚未处理的偶遇事件。'>><br><br>
  <<templeicon 'pew'>><<lanLink ['Return to the bench', '回到长椅'] 'RobinTemple Prayer'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <<exit>>
<</if>>
<<set $RobinTemple.prayer_event_done to true>>
<<switch $RobinTemple.prayer_event>>
  <<case 1>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<if $soup_kitchen_known>>You recognise the address on the visitor's note: the kitchen on Wolf Street. Robin reads through the request.<<else>>The visitor has come from Wolf Street. The soup kitchen needs clean bowls before evening.<</if>> <<if $RobinTemple.service gte 10>>Robin checks how many bowls are needed before taking a box from the shelves.<<else>>Robin offers to carry a box from the shelves.<</if>>
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<if $soup_kitchen_known>>你认出访客便条上的地址，是狼街的厨房。罗宾读过物资请求。<<else>>那名访客从狼街来。施粥所在开门前缺一批干净的碗。<</if>><<if $RobinTemple.service gte 10>>罗宾先问清需要多少只碗，才从架上搬下一箱。<<else>>罗宾提出从架上搬一箱过去。<</if>>
    <</language>>
    <br><br>
    <<robin-temple-prayer-time 30>>
    <<if _robinPrayerTime>>
      <<templeicon 'quarters'>><<lanLink ['Help deliver bowls (0:30)', '帮忙送碗 (0:30)'] 'RobinTemple Prayer Bowls'>><</lanLink>><br>
    <</if>>
    <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink ['Make a note of what the soup kitchen needs', '记下施粥所需要什么'] 'RobinTemple Prayer Note'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <<case 2>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        The initiate has written the wrong number beside the linen and fears Jordan will think a whole bundle is missing.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        见习教徒说自己在布巾清单上写错了数，担心约旦以为少了一整捆。
    <</language>>
    <br><br>
    <<robin-temple-prayer-time 15>>
    <<if _robinPrayerTime>>
      <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink ['Check the list with Robin (0:15)', '和罗宾一起核对清单 (0:15)'] 'RobinTemple Prayer List'>><</lanLink>><<ggrace>><<gconviction 'Robin'>><br>
    <</if>>
    <<loveicon 'hug'>><<lanLink ['Ask Robin to comfort the initiate first', '请罗宾先安慰见习教徒'] 'RobinTemple Prayer Comfort'>><</lanLink>><<glove>><<ggconviction 'Robin'>><br>
  <<case 3>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        The visitor has nowhere quiet to sit tonight. Robin looks toward the quarters, then offers a cup of water first.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        访客说今晚找不到安静的地方坐一会儿。罗宾望向宿舍方向，先端来一杯水。
    <</language>>
    <br><br>
    <<robin-temple-prayer-time 15>>
    <<if _robinPrayerTime and maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').jordanAvailable>>
      <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink ['Ask Jordan with Robin (0:15)', '帮罗宾去问约旦 (0:15)'] 'RobinTemple Prayer Shelter'>><</lanLink>><br>
    <</if>>
    <<if maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').jordanAvailable>>
      <<templeicon 'altar'>><<lanLink ['Stay with the visitor', '留下来陪访客等候'] 'RobinTemple Prayer Wait'>><</lanLink>><br>
    <</if>>
  <<case 4>>
    <<if C.npc.Robin.trauma gte 40>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          Robin flinches at a raised voice behind the door. <<He>> moves closer to you and looks toward the hall. "Could we ask Jordan?" <<he>> whispers.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          门后有人提高了嗓门，罗宾一颤，朝你靠近了一些，又望向大厅。“能去问问约旦吗？”<<he>>小声说。
      <</language>>
    <<elseif C.npc.Robin.dom lte 50>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          Robin says <<he>> heard arguing behind the door. Neither of you knows what happened. <<He>> looks at you. "Should we ask Jordan?"
        <<option 'CN'>>
          罗宾说听见门后有人争执。你们都不知道发生了什么。<<He>>看向你：“要不要问问约旦？”
      <</language>>
    <<else>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          Robin says <<he>> heard someone arguing behind the side-room door. Neither of you knows what happened. "We can ask Jordan," <<he>> says, "rather than guessing."
        <<option 'CN'>>
          罗宾说听见侧室里有人争执。你们都不知道发生了什么。“可以去问约旦，”<<he>>说，“别只在这里猜。”
      <</language>>
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    <<if maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').jordanAvailable>>
      <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink ['Ask Jordan what happened', '请约旦说明情况'] 'RobinTemple Prayer Ask Jordan'>><</lanLink>><<gdom>><<gconviction 'Robin'>><br>
    <</if>>
    <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Leave with Robin for now', '先和罗宾离开'] 'RobinTemple Prayer Leave'>><</lanLink>><br>
<</switch>>
<br>
<<templeicon 'pew'>><<lanLink ['Return to the bench', '回到长椅'] 'RobinTemple Prayer'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Prayer Bowls
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<robin-temple-prayer-time 30>>
<<if _robinPrayerTime and $RobinTemple.prayer_event_day is Time.days and $RobinTemple.prayer_event is 1 and !$RobinTemple.prayer_event_resolved>>
  <<set $RobinTemple.prayer_event_resolved to true>>
  <<pass 30>>
  <<robin-temple-work-check>>
<<else>>
  <<set _robinWork to false>>
<</if>>
<<if _robinWork>>
  <<set _prayerService to $RobinTemple.service>>
  <<set _kitchenKnown to Boolean($soup_kitchen_known)>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You and Robin wrap the bowls in linen and carry them to the kitchen on Wolf Street. <<if _kitchenKnown>>The cook clears an end of the table and checks the delivery against the request Robin has brought.<<else>>The cook shows you where to set the box, then counts the bowls before setting a pot on the stove.<</if>> <<if _prayerService gte 10>>Robin folds the empty wrapping while you wait for the receipt. "That's everything on the list?" <<he>> asks before you leave.<</if>>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你和罗宾用布巾包好碗，送到狼街的厨房。<<if _kitchenKnown>>厨师腾出桌子的一角，对照罗宾带来的便条，清点这次送来的碗。<<else>>厨师告诉你把箱子放在哪里，数过碗，才把锅架上炉灶。<</if>><<if _prayerService gte 10>>你等收条时，罗宾叠好空布巾。“清单上的都齐了吧？”离开前，<<he>>又问了一遍。<</if>>
  <</language>>
  <<set $soup_kitchen_known to 1>><<set $RobinTemple.service += 1>>
  <<grace 2>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><<ggrace>><<glove>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      There is no unfinished encounter here today.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      今天这里已经没有尚未处理的偶遇事件。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the temple', '回到神殿'] 'Temple'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Prayer Note
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<robin-temple-work-check>>
<<if _robinWork and $RobinTemple.prayer_event_day is Time.days and $RobinTemple.prayer_event is 1 and !$RobinTemple.prayer_event_resolved>>
  <<set $RobinTemple.prayer_event_resolved to true>>
  <<set _kitchenKnown to Boolean($soup_kitchen_known)>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<if _kitchenKnown>>
        You confirm the kitchen's opening hours with the visitor. Robin writes down what is running short and the quantities needed.
      <<else>>
        The visitor shows you the kitchen's address and hours. Robin copies them into <<his>> schoolbook so neither of you has to rely on memory.
      <</if>>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<if _kitchenKnown>>
        你向访客核实厨房的开放时间。罗宾记下这次短缺的物品和所需数量。
      <<else>>
        访客告诉你厨房的位置和开放时间。罗宾把它们抄进课本，免得你们全靠记忆。
      <</if>>
  <</language>>
  <<set $soup_kitchen_known to 1>>
  <<if !_kitchenKnown>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <span class='gold'>You learned where to find the soup kitchen.</span>
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <span class='gold'>你得知了施粥所的位置。</span>
    <</language>>
  <</if>><br><br>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      There is no unfinished encounter here today.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      今天这里已经没有尚未处理的偶遇事件。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<templeicon 'pew'>><<lanLink ['Return to the bench', '回到长椅'] 'RobinTemple Prayer'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Prayer List
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<robin-temple-prayer-time 15>>
<<if _robinPrayerTime and $RobinTemple.prayer_event_day is Time.days and $RobinTemple.prayer_event is 2 and !$RobinTemple.prayer_event_resolved>>
  <<set $RobinTemple.prayer_event_resolved to true>>
  <<pass 15>>
  <<robin-temple-work-check>>
<<else>>
  <<set _robinWork to false>>
<</if>>
<<if _robinWork>>
  <<set _prayerService to $RobinTemple.service>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<if _prayerService gte 10>>Robin asks which shelf was counted last, then takes you to the next room. The missing bundle is where the previous shift left it. <<He>> waits while the initiate counts it, rather than giving them the number.<<else>>You count each bundle with Robin. The missing linen is on a shelf in the next room.<</if>> The initiate corrects the entry while you hold the pages together.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<if _prayerService gte 10>>罗宾问清最后数到哪个架子，带你去隔壁看。漏记的捆包就放在上一班留下的位置。<<He>>等见习教徒自己数过，没有直接报出数量。<<else>>你和罗宾逐捆清点。漏记的布巾就放在隔壁的架子上。<</if>>你扶住纸页，让见习教徒把数字改好。
  <</language>>
  <<set $RobinTemple.service += 1>>
  <<set maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').faith += 2>><<gconviction 'Robin'>>
  <<grace 1>><<ggrace>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      There is no unfinished encounter here today.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      今天这里已经没有尚未处理的偶遇事件。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<templeicon 'pew'>><<lanLink ['Return to the bench', '回到长椅'] 'RobinTemple Prayer'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Prayer Comfort
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<robin-temple-work-check>>
<<if _robinWork and $RobinTemple.prayer_event_day is Time.days and $RobinTemple.prayer_event is 2 and !$RobinTemple.prayer_event_resolved>>
  <<set $RobinTemple.prayer_event_resolved to true>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<if $RobinTemple.service gte 10 and C.npc.Robin.trauma lt 40>>Robin folds the list to the right column and sets it between them. "I used to lose my place here too." <<He>> waits until the initiate can point to the mistake.<<else>>Robin sits with the initiate until the mistake can be explained.<</if>> "We should check the shelves," Robin says. The two of you find the bundle and correct the list together.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<if $RobinTemple.service gte 10 and C.npc.Robin.trauma lt 40>>罗宾把清单折到相应的那一栏，摆在两人中间。“我以前也会看串行。”<<He>>等见习教徒指出写错的地方。<<else>>罗宾陪见习教徒坐了一会儿，等对方说清错在哪里。<</if>>“先看看架子吧，”罗宾说。你们找到那捆布巾，一起改好清单。
  <</language>>
  <<set maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').faith += 3>><<ggconviction 'Robin'>>
  <<npcincr Robin love 1>><<glove>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      There is no unfinished encounter here today.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      今天这里已经没有尚未处理的偶遇事件。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<templeicon 'pew'>><<lanLink ['Return to the bench', '回到长椅'] 'RobinTemple Prayer'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Prayer Shelter
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<robin-temple-prayer-time 15>>
<<if _robinPrayerTime and $RobinTemple.prayer_event_day is Time.days and $RobinTemple.prayer_event is 3 and !$RobinTemple.prayer_event_resolved and maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').jordanAvailable>>
  <<set $RobinTemple.prayer_event_resolved to true>>
  <<pass 15>>
  <<robin-temple-work-check>>
<<else>>
  <<set _robinWork to false>>
<</if>>
<<if _robinWork and maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').jordanAvailable>>
  <<set _prayerService to $RobinTemple.service>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Jordan listens to the visitor and offers a place to rest until morning. <<if _prayerService gte 10>>Robin checks which bunk is free with the attendant, then leaves water and a clean blanket at its foot. "I'll show you where to put your things."<<else>>Robin fetches water and a clean blanket, then asks whether the visitor needs anything else.<</if>>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      约旦听完访客的情况，同意让对方留到天亮。<<if _prayerService gte 10>>罗宾和侍从核过空床，在床脚放好水和干净的毯子。“我带你去放东西。”<<else>>罗宾端来水和干净的毯子，又问还有没有别的需要。<</if>>
  <</language>>
  <<set $RobinTemple.service += 1>>
  <<grace 2>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><<ggrace>><<glove>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      There is no unfinished encounter here today.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      今天这里已经没有尚未处理的偶遇事件。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<templeicon 'pew'>><<lanLink ['Return to the bench', '回到长椅'] 'RobinTemple Prayer'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Prayer Wait
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<robin-temple-work-check>>
<<if _robinWork and $RobinTemple.prayer_event_day is Time.days and $RobinTemple.prayer_event is 3 and !$RobinTemple.prayer_event_resolved and maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').jordanAvailable>>
  <<set $RobinTemple.prayer_event_resolved to true>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You stay beside the visitor while Robin speaks to Jordan. When <<he>> returns, <<he>> has a blanket and permission for the visitor to rest in the quarters.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾去找约旦时，你留在访客身边。<<He>>带着毯子回来，也带来了让访客在宿舍休息的许可。
  <</language>>
  <<npcincr Robin love 1>><<stress -2>><<glove>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      There is no unfinished encounter here today.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      今天这里已经没有尚未处理的偶遇事件。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<templeicon 'pew'>><<lanLink ['Return to the bench', '回到长椅'] 'RobinTemple Prayer'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Prayer Ask Jordan
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<robin-temple-work-check>>
<<if _robinWork and $RobinTemple.prayer_event_day is Time.days and $RobinTemple.prayer_event is 4 and !$RobinTemple.prayer_event_resolved and maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').jordanAvailable>>
  <<set $RobinTemple.prayer_event_resolved to true>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Jordan says an initiate became frightened during a task. "The attendants will see to them," <<nnpc_he 'Jordan'>> says. "The temple looks after its own."
    <<option 'CN'>>
      约旦说，一名见习教徒在做事时受了惊吓。“侍从会照看他们，”<<nnpc_he 'Jordan'>>说，“神殿不会放着不管。”
  <</language>>
  <<if C.npc.Robin.trauma gte 40>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Robin nods without asking anything more. Outside the room, <<he>> asks you to sit with <<him>> for a while.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        罗宾点点头，没有再问。出了房间，<<he>>请你陪<<him>>坐一会儿。
    <</language>>
  <<elseif C.npc.Robin.dom lte 50>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        "Is the initiate all right?" Robin asks quietly. Jordan says they are resting, and that there is nothing more the two of you can do. Robin looks only a little relieved.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        “那名见习教徒还好吗？”罗宾小声问。约旦说对方正在休息，别的事不用你们操心。罗宾只稍微松了口气。
    <</language>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Robin asks if <<he>> can bring the initiate some water. Jordan nods and tells <<him>> where to go. <<if $RobinTemple.service gte 10>>Robin repeats the room back to make sure, then takes a cup from the shelf.<</if>>
      <<option 'CN'>>
        罗宾问能不能给那名见习教徒送些水。约旦点头，告诉<<him>>该去哪里。<<if $RobinTemple.service gte 10>>罗宾重复一遍房间的位置，确认没有听错，才从架上拿杯子。<</if>>
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
  <<set maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').faith += 2>><<gconviction 'Robin'>>
  <<npcincr Robin dom 1>><<gdom>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      There is no unfinished encounter here today.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      今天这里已经没有尚未处理的偶遇事件。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<templeicon 'pew'>><<lanLink ['Return to the bench', '回到长椅'] 'RobinTemple Prayer'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Prayer Leave
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<robin-temple-work-check>>
<<if _robinWork and $RobinTemple.prayer_event_day is Time.days and $RobinTemple.prayer_event is 4 and !$RobinTemple.prayer_event_resolved>>
  <<set $RobinTemple.prayer_event_resolved to true>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You leave the side room behind. Robin walks with you to the hall. <<He>> glances back once before sitting beside you on the pew.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你离开侧室门前。罗宾陪你走到大厅，回头看了一眼，才在长椅上挨着你坐下。
  <</language>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      There is no unfinished encounter here today.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      今天这里已经没有尚未处理的偶遇事件。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<templeicon 'pew'>><<lanLink ['Return to the bench', '回到长椅'] 'RobinTemple Prayer'>><</lanLink>><br>
